Date: 2026-04-23
Descriptor: motif_refinement (validates ADR 0017)
Purpose:
    Verify that representative refinement replaces embedded
    representatives with clean ones when a clean alternative exists
    in the data. Also confirm the determinism fix (sorted data edges)
    produces stable output across process runs.

Mechanism version:
    ADR 0017 (RefinementConfig, refine_candidates,
    is_clean_subgraph public helper, data_edges_sorted for
    cross-run determinism).
    Source: v2/src/lib.rs at the commit implementing 0017.
    Runner: v2/examples/motif_refinement.rs.

Command:
    cargo run --example motif_refinement

